    "Servono almeno un simbolo e un'impronta nella libreria del circuito: importali con LIBRERIA › Importa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The circuit library needs at least a symbol and a footprint: import them with LIBRARY › Import."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电路库中至少需要一个符号和一个封装：请通过 LIBRARY › 导入 导入它们。"
          }
        }
      }
